sagittarius_data = {
    "effect": "Venus represents how you perceive and express love, and Sagittarius is a fire sign where your love is passionate and bold, which makes you restless. Commitment can be hard for those individuals with Venus in Sagittarius, but once you connect with the partner of your intellectual and adventurous match, you are extremely loyal and loving in your relationship.\n\nWhen Venus moves in the Sagittarius sign, it creates romantic, passionate, and adventurous energy, which indicates that this is the time to explore your relationships on the surface but also to observe your emotional quotient for your partner within.\n\nThere is an innate desire for freedom in relationships and you have the wish to connect to the partner who respects your need for independence in a relationship and shares your interests for fun and excitement. You have the tendency to get attracted to the honest and optimistic nature of your partner.\n\nVenus in Sagittarius on social platforms indicates that this placement stimulates rational discussions with your partner and the desire for truth and justice in relationships. This is a strong opportunity to nurture our relationships with passion, and mutual respect that encourages us to explore progress and seek authenticity in our relationships.",
    "retrogradeEffect": "When Venus is retrograde in Sagittarius it is evident that you may have troubles in getting along well with your partner. Your love for personal independence may come in the way of a committed relationship. Your self-centred nature messes with your love equation with your partner and there is less or no progress in your love relationship.\n\nRetrograde Venus in Sagittarius in your horoscope indicates that you may have difficulty in giving /receiving love and affection from your partner. You may have to experience setback in your love relationships where challenges from your previous relationships may come on the forefront.\n\nYou love your freedom/independence in mutual relationship, retrograde Venus in Sagittarius often make you fear of commitment in relationship and you keep your individual space in any relationship.\n\nRetrograde Venus in Sagittarius in any natal chart gives a complex and intense approach to love relationships where there is an intense need for personal space from your partner in relationships.",
    "combustEffect": "When Venus is combust in Sagittarius, it means that Venus is in the same sign as the Sun, or it is too close to the Sun in degrees in your horoscope. When Venus is combust , it is said that it loses some of its power and individuality due to the overwhelming influence of Sun on the qualities of the combust planet.\n\nVenus represents love/marriage relationships, so combust Venus in Sagittarius in any individual’s horoscope can impact love/marriage relationships and you may have troubles searching for an appropriate partner for marriage or relationships.\n\nYou are likely to face turbulence in personal front and in social interactions with others. Combust Venus in Sagittarius obscures your ability to make sound decisions related to relationships, finances, and partnerships, making you unable to judge the authenticity of any relationships/situations.\n\nOn the other hand, the malefic association of Sun with Venus in Sagittarius can cause problems related to your health, profession, and marriage. You may have to face financial losses due to your impulsive behaviour.",
    "houses": {
        "1": "Venus in Sagittarius can influence your personality and approach towards life. It can bring warmth and free will to your personality, enhancing your social interactions, your approach to love, which encourages you to hold life with joy and optimism, and be mindful of maintaining balance and truthfulness in your pursuits. You are likely to possess a charming and attractive behavior where everyone may find you sociable and easy to get along with. You convey warmth and friendliness in your relations with others, which can make you popular. You enjoy meeting new people and forming connections. You may have a natural talent for diplomacy, peacemaking, and you appreciate harmony in your immediate environment.\n\nYou're attracted to people in relationships who share your love for adventure, knowledge, and personal growth with a positive and optimistic attitude towards life, eager to explore new opportunities and experiences. Venus in Sagittarius here can make you self-centered or superficial due to your ability to be overindulgent in situations/relationships, so it is necessary for you to make efforts and strive to maintain balance in your relationships and priorities.",
        "2": "Venus in Sagittarius here can influence your values, finances, relationships, and material assets with a blend of optimism, generosity, appreciation for beauty, and comfort in your approach to life and relationships. Balancing these traits with your courage and strength of mind can lead to a fulfilling and unrestrained life journey. Your values and beliefs in life are influenced by Venusians traits such as beauty, harmony, and pleasure but they may possess a sense of adventure and a love for freedom.\n\nYou may seek partners who share your values, appreciate your generosity and warmth but on the other hand, you may value independence/freedom in your relationships. Your approach towards your finances is likely to be optimistic and unreserved, although you may have the habit of being generous with your wealth and resources. You have a keen appreciation for the finer things in life, and you may enjoy surrounding yourself with luxury, but your love for freedom might make you less attached to material possessions compared to others due to Venus in Sagittarius.\n\nYou have to be careful about guarding your instincts against overindulgence in your expenditures, which can be your potential challenge for financial stability.",
        "3": "Venus in Sagittarius here suggests a unique blend of charm and intellect in your communication skills, social grace, appreciation for beauty, and harmony in your immediate environment. You excel in social interactions and have a knack for finding contentment in the little things in life. You possess a diplomatic communication style where you have a way with words, and your conversations are often infused with warmth, grace, and tact, making it easy for you to connect with others on a superficial level. This placement fosters a love for knowledge and exploration, which is further emphasized where you might have a talent for creative writing, storytelling, or other forms of self-expression.\n\nYou have a strong desire for social interaction and networking, and you may enjoy attending social events, gatherings, or activities where you can participate in stimulating conversations and connect with like-minded individuals. Your ability to charm and communicate effectively makes you popular among your peers/siblings with harmonious and affectionate relationship.\n\nBut on the other hand, it may indicate a tendency towards indecisiveness, where you might find yourself weighing various options before making a choice, sometimes struggling to commit to a particular course of action related to the concerned situation or relationship.",
        "4": "Venus in Sagittarius here can influence your domestic life, family relationships, and emotional well-being. Blessed with a sense of grace and harmony, creating a nurturing and beautiful domestic environment is essential to your sense of happiness and fulfillment. You may enjoy decorating your home with beautiful elements that create a sense of comfort and luxury, but you will value peace in your domestic space and strive to create nurturing atmosphere/relationships for yourself and your loved ones. You hold a strong connection with your family and you feel a strong sense of loyalty and attachment to your familial relationships.\n\nYour ability to understand and connect with others on an emotional level is one of your greatest strengths, and you may often find yourself playing the role of mediator or peacemaker in family conflicts. You are a social being, but you value your personal space and may prefer close gatherings with friends/family over large social events. Creating a sense of security within your home is important to you, but it's also important to keep yourself from becoming overly attached to or dependent on these relationships for fulfillment.",
        "5": "Venus in Sagittarius here suggests a love for creativity, romance and enjoyment of life's pleasures and your approach to relationships is with warmth, playfulness, and a sense of adventure where you seek fulfillment through understanding and meaningful connections. You possess a natural talent for creative self-expression that makes you excel in artistic pursuits such as music, dance, or visual arts. Your creativity carries a sense of joy and playfulness where you may find fulfillment in exploring various forms of artistic expression as a means of self-discovery and enjoyment. You may be attracted to passionate and adventurous partner who share your love for excitement and spontaneity.\n\nYour relationships are characterized by warmth, affection, with a desire to have fun and enjoyment with your partner. You have an optimistic and adventurous outlook on life and the strong desire of spending time with children, engaging in playful activities for fostering their creativity and growth or deriving fulfillment from nurturing and mentoring others.\n\nVenus in Sagittarius enhances your ability for pleasure and enjoyment. It's important to find a balance between indulgence and responsibility in maintaining harmony in your life.",
        "6": "Venus in Sagittarius here suggests that you seek a harmonious and pleasant work environment where you may be attracted to professions that allow you to engage in activities you enjoy related to creativity or social interaction. You will value the importance of cooperation and teamwork in your workplace. You have the ability to build connections with colleagues in your work environment. Your charm, diplomacy, and ability to collaborate effectively make you well-liked among coworkers, where you may find opportunities to expand your social circle through your professional interactions.\n\nYou have a sympathetic nature and may excel in a role that involves care giving, counseling, or healing. You may find fulfillment in helping others,’ that promotes others’ well-being and harmony. This placement encourages you to give importance to your physical health and well-being and engage in keen interest in activities that promote wellness, such as yoga, meditation, or holistic practices.\n\nIt's important to maintain a healthy balance between your professional and personal lives, where you may need to be mindful of not over committing yourself to work at the expense of other areas of your life.",
        "7": "Venus in Sagittarius here influences your relationships, harmony, and balance in your life. Your approach to personal partnerships is blessed with warmth, diplomacy, and desire for mutual respect and understanding. Your optimistic nature contributes to your ability to create fulfilling connections with others where you have the natural ability for diplomacy and negotiation, which helps you find the way in personal relationships with charm.\n\nYou seek harmonious and balanced connections with others, and you may excel in settling conflicts or finding compromises that satisfy all the concerned people. You may feel a requirement for a close relationship with your partner and may actively seek out romantic partnerships that fulfill your emotional and social needs. You have an optimistic approach in all aspects of life, which is further emphasized in your approach to love and partnerships.\n\nOn the other hand, you may possess a strong sense of justice and fairness in your relationships, and you will strive to maintain a sense of balance and equality with your partners and may work enthusiastically to address and resolve any existing issues in relationships.",
        "8": "Venus in Sagittarius here indicates a change in approach to love, intimacy, and shared possessions. You are attracted to strong emotional connections and may seek to survey the deeper meaning of life and relationships with courage and curiosity. You thrive on the emotional depth and intimacy that comes with important connections in your life. Your relationships may undergo significant transformations over time, leading to mutual growth and evolution of your relationship with your partner/spouse or family.\n\nThis placement here indicates your strong desire for emotional intimacy and connection in your relationships where you will be attuned to the emotional needs of your partner and will make efforts to establish a deep bond based on the satisfaction of your partner’s needs. You will be attracted to study the subjects related to the deeper meanings of life, spirituality, human nature, and connections. You may be attracted to partners who have a strong financial or material presence, and you may find fulfillment in teaming up your resources together for mutual benefit.\n\nYour personal and love relationship here indicates depth and intensity to your relationships, but it also has the potential for possessiveness within your relationships, but it is best to maintain healthy boundaries and mutual respect with your partner.",
        "9": "Venus in Sagittarius here brings a love approach for you with a sense of optimism, adventure, and romance, seeking partners who share your intellectual curiosity and higher aspirations for life. You have a deep appreciation for knowledge and philosophy. You may be drawn to partners who share your intellectual curiosity and love for learning. Your relationships may be characterized by stimulating conversations, and a mutual desire for growth and expansion.\n\nYou may be attracted to partners from different cultural backgrounds or enjoy exploring new cultures and traditions together. Your relationships may be enriched by a sense of frankness and patience towards different ways of life. You may seek partners who share your love for exploration and new experiences, and you may find fulfillment in relationships with partners who represent qualities such as honesty, integrity, and a sense of purpose.\n\nYour relationships may be guided by a shared vision for the future and a desire to make a positive impact on the world. This placement may indicate a desire for spiritual or philosophical connection within your relationships.",
        "10": "Venus in Sagittarius here indicates a career that is marked by skill and visual sensibility. You excel in professions that allow you to display your creativity, personal skills, and ability to promote positive relationships with others, leading to success and fulfillment in your profession. You possess a diplomatic behavior in your professional life where you may excel in careers that involve public relations, customer service, or any field where interpersonal skills are important.\n\nYour ability to maintain your social relations with tact and diplomacy can enhance your professional success and reputation. You may pay attention to your appearance, personal style, presentation of your work or business. Your sense of refinement can contribute to your professional appeal and credibility. You have a harmonious and cooperative approach in working with others, whether it’s collaborating with colleagues, forming strategic agreement, or building professional networks. Your ability to encourage positive relationships with others can open doors to new opportunities and advancements in your career.\n\nWhile Venus in the 10th house can bring success and recognition in your career, it's important for you to maintain a healthy balance between your personal and professional life.",
        "11": "Venus in Sagittarius here indicates an optimistic approach to friendships and relationships where you can connect with others and collaborate on shared interests. Your charm, diplomacy enhances your social interactions and contributes to the harmony and enthusiasm in your social circles. Your charm, warmth, and sociability make you well-liked among your peers, and you may have a talent for bringing people together and develop a sense of companionship within your social groups.\n\nThis placement highlights the importance of friendship and collaboration in your life. You may excel in group activities, team projects, or networking events where you can connect with like-minded individuals and work towards common goals. You have a natural talent for networking and building social connections that can benefit you professionally and personally.\n\nYour ability to charm and engage with others can open doors to new opportunities, collaborations, and friendships. Your friendships are often based on shared values, interests, and common goals. You may be drawn to individuals who inspire you intellectually, creatively, or spiritually, and share your aspirations for personal growth and collective progress.",
        "12": "Venus in Sagittarius here can influence your approach to love and relationships. You may be compassionate, selfless, and have a deep capacity for unconditional love and empathy, seeking to connect with others on a soulful level. Your romantic fantasies and desires may be influenced by a sense of spiritual connection or longing for a meaningful union with your partner/loved ones.\n\nYou may experience relationships that are secretive or involve a degree of secrecy. You may be attracted to partners who are mysterious, or you may prefer to keep your romantic affairs private. Venus in Sagittarius in the 12th house can indicate a willingness to sacrifice and surrender for the sake of love or to maintain harmony in relationships.\n\nYou may be attracted to the acts of selflessness or service within your partnerships, sometimes at the expense of your own needs or desires. Learning to draw healthy boundaries and self-care practices is important for maintaining balance and well-being."
    },
    "remedies": []
}

with open(VENUS_JS, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    content = f.read()

signs_match = re.search(r'signs:\s*\{', content)
if signs_match:
    insertion_point = signs_match.end()
    sagittarius_json = "      Sagittarius: " + json.dumps(sagittarius_data, indent=8) + ","
    new_content = content[:insertion_point] + "\n" + sagittarius_json + content[insertion_point:]
    
    with open(VENUS_JS, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:
        f.write(new_content)
    print("Added Venus in Sagittarius to venus.js")
else:
    print("Could not find signs object in venus.js")
